ass, giving control to my teammate\n- Prevents landlord from playing their last card and winning\n\nReason:\nWith the landlord holding only 1 card, I must play a combination they cannot beat. A straight of 6 cards forces the landlord to pass (single cards cannot beat straights), preventing them from winning this turn. This gives control to my teammate who can then help finish the game. Any single card or pair risks the landlord being able to respond and potentially win.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3", "♥4", "♣5", "♥6", "♠7", "♦8"]}'}
